<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan leu edges up to 4.6655 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Moldovan leu edges up to 4.6655 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu edged up to 4.6655 to the dollar on the Moldovan Interbank Currency Exchange from 4.667 on Mar 5.</p>
<p>				    Mar 6	 Mar 5</p>
<p> lei per dollar		 4.6655	4.6670</p>
<p> volume traded ($)	    300,000     600,000</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
